			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>: abs., <i>PLond.ined.</i><i><span class="en">
				2313r
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>: —
				Med.
			, <i>discharge prematurely,</i>
			
